          "With demand, inventory, and logistics operating at peak efficiency, we construct Pillar 4 of the Grand Capstone: Cognitive Sourcing, Contract Risk Auditing & Automated 3-Way Reconciliation. An enterprise supply chain is only as resilient as its supplier network. If procurement contracts contain hidden liabilities, vendors face unmonitored financial insolvency, or accounts payable leaks millions through fraudulent invoices and maverick spend, the entire enterprise is exposed to disruption.",
