          "answer": 0,
          "answerIndex": 0,
          "why": "Synchronous blocking forces calling agents to wait idly while downstream models generate tokens. A single slow or deadlocked model stalls all upstream agents, exhausting system sockets and causing systemic cascade failure. Asynchronous mailboxes decouple execution completely.",
          "explanation": "Synchronous blocking forces calling agents to wait idly while downstream models generate tokens. A single slow or deadlocked model stalls all upstream agents, exhausting system sockets and causing systemic cascade failure. Asynchronous mailboxes decouple execution completely."
