    "goal": "Architect enterprise-grade autonomous tool execution engines: implement semantic function calling registries, construct defensive JSON schema validators with automated type coercion, build secure sandboxed execution wrappers, and orchestrate fault-tolerant distributed Saga transactions with compensating rollbacks.",
