          "At the apex of this cognitive system sits the Master Command Bridge. The Command Bridge is not merely an observational monitoring dashboard; it is an active supervisory orchestrator. It manages the global event mesh, registers cross-domain Blackboard state transitions, coordinates inter-swarm dependency handoffs, enforces corporate delegation-of-authority limits, and tracks overall swarm operational velocity against enterprise key performance indicators (KPIs).",
