          "Congratulations! You have reached the capstone synthesis of Day 38. Over the preceding four parts, we systematically dismantled the boundaries of vector-only RAG: proving why multi-hop queries fail without relational graphs, engineering automated entity-relation extraction pipelines with canonicalization, implementing modularity-based community detection for global sensemaking, and formulating hybrid vector-seeded ego-network retrieval.",
          "Now, we unite these pillars into an enterprise masterpiece: The Master GraphRAG Knowledge Mesh & Multi-Hop Query Engine. This architecture represents the pinnacle of enterprise cognitive information retrieval, deployed by global investment banks, forensic accounting firms, and intelligence agencies to solve the most complex, high-stakes corporate compliance investigations.",
