          "In enterprise fiduciary benchmarks, this Knowledge Mesh architecture achieves extraordinary audit accuracy: it improves Multi-Hop Question Answering Accuracy from 41% (for vector-only RAG) to 96%, while reducing factual hallucination rates to virtually zero. Corporate auditors and compliance officers can trace every AI assertion directly back to verified graph edge provenance.",
