          "In summary, the Enterprise GraphRAG Knowledge Mesh establishes a new paradigm for corporate cognitive computing. By replacing fragile, isolated vector searches with a resilient, interconnected relational graph, it endows the modern enterprise with deep situational awareness, transparent auditability, and multi-hop reasoning capabilities, unlocking an unassailable strategic advantage across global regulatory compliance, risk management, and executive strategy.",
