          "explanation": "In safety-critical enterprise AI, a catastrophic failure in one metric (e.g. 0% faithfulness = hallucination) ruins the entire response. An arithmetic average of (1.0 + 0.0 + 1.0)/3 = 0.67 looks mediocre, whereas the harmonic mean drops to 0.0, correctly failing the pipeline."
