          "Finally, automated RAG governance delivers profound Economic Return on Investment (ROI). Legacy enterprises spend tens of millions of dollars annually on manual paralegal contract review, forensic audit sampling, and external compliance consulting to catch operational errors. By deploying an autonomous, mathematically certified RAG Triad governance firewall with closed-loop self-correction, organizations eliminate ninety-five percent of manual audit friction, slash regulatory non-compliance liability, and establish an unassailable competitive moat in autonomous digital transformation.",
          "At the architectural zenith, the Industrial RAG Triad Governance Engine serves as the fiduciary immune system of the autonomous enterprise. By uniting automated retrieval noise filtering, mathematical claim entailment verification, and closed-loop corrective self-healing, it guarantees that enterprise AI applications deliver unassailable factual integrity, safeguarding institutional trust and empowering corporate leadership to execute autonomous digital transformation with complete confidence.",
          "In this final masterclass implementation, we construct the complete Industrial RAG Triad Governance & Self-Correction Engine in standard Python. We simulate an enterprise financial risk scenario, execute real-time context relevance evaluation, decompose generated answers into atomic claims, trigger automated query rewriting when needed, verify complete factual entailment, and confer the official Enterprise Fiduciary RAG Certification.",
