          "The operational lifecycle of this end-to-end alignment engine proceeds through four synchronized phases: (1) Golden Ingestion & Evol-Instruct Synthesis: The engine ingests authoritative corporate policy documentation, generating diverse, complex multi-constraint instruction prompts; (2) Multi-Candidate Generation & Rejection Sampling: The model samples $K$ candidate outputs per prompt, filtering them through factual entailment, length constraints, and rule-based validation to select the single winning golden response $y_w$; (3) Contrastive Negative Generation: The rejected candidates or targeted adversarial perturbations are formatted into explicit losing responses $y_l$, creating the contrastive preference dataset $(x, y_w, y_l)$; and (4) Direct Preference Optimization (DPO) Training: The model is trained directly on the preference pairs using closed-form implicit reward optimization with hyperparameter $beta=0.1$, maximizing the likelihood of fiduciary decisions while systematically suppressing reckless hallucinations.",
