          "Line 59-70: Sizing an 8B model in INT4: raw weights take only 4.0 GB VRAM, achieving 252 tokens/sec throughput and over $380,000 in 3-year net savings.",
          "Line 72: Demonstrates the compelling edge economics and sovereign viability of Small Language Models on premise."
