          "why": "Leviathan's rejection sampling formula min(1, P/Q) coupled with residual sampling mathematically guarantees that the sampling distribution matches the target model's true distribution with zero Kullback-Leibler divergence.",
          "explanation": "Leviathan's rejection sampling formula min(1, P/Q) coupled with residual sampling mathematically guarantees that the sampling distribution matches the target model's true distribution with zero Kullback-Leibler divergence."
