          "Line 40-62: `process_telemetry_loop()` executes embedded Micro-RAG (4.1ms) + model reasoning (36.4ms) = 40.5ms total.",
          "Line 72-84: Detects 912.4 PSI surge, passes 50ms SLA, and dispatches statutory emergency valve vent command."
