          "Multi-cloud token arbitrage further optimizes variable compute expenditure. The gateway continuously tracks spot instance availability and real-time per-token API pricing across AWS Bedrock, Azure OpenAI, Google Vertex AI, and private on-premises Kubernetes clusters. When non-sensitive batch workloads are submitted, the gateway routes jobs to the lowest-cost provider within geographical compliance boundaries, capturing cost arbitrage while maintaining strict service level objectives.",
