          "In this final masterclass implementation, we construct the complete Enterprise AI FinOps & Distributed Telemetry Gateway in standard Python. We execute an end-to-end commercial transaction, verify semantic caching and budget governance, emit standardized OpenTelemetry trace spans, calculate realized cost savings, and confer the official Certified Enterprise AI FinOps Architect (CEAFA) credential.",
